        "title": "",
        "content": "<p>*Claims and statistics on this page, including but not limited to maximum energy value, flashing frequency, and sapphire temperature during continuous use (if mentioned), are derived from Ulike's internal data or third-party reports under specific test environments.</p><p>**Hair reduction results and time for full or part body lighting (if mentioned) on this page are tested by third-party laboratory and individual results of both may vary. Specifically, hair reduction results may vary for different body area, different using durations and different measured parameters.</p><p>***The period of soft or smooth skin (if mentioned) on this page is subject to follow the recommended regime and individual results may vary.</p><p>****Any mention of \"The world’s No.1 hair removal device brand in 2023\" refer to the source: Frost& Sullivan, confirmed based on research on global hair removal device market and calculated by 2023 global sales volume metrics. Hair removal device refers to a beauty instrument that targets hair follicles using technologies such as lasers and intense pulsed light (IPL), with the aim of reducing or removing hair. Common types include IPL devices and laser hair removal devices. The survey was completed in October 2024.</p><p>*****Any mention fo SHR refer to a mode by harvesting heat accumulation by multiple IPL pulses for better hair removal results and a more comfortable experience.<br/><br/></p>",
